# basePath Chapter2

:: FirstContractOpenCh2
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once

{@Player}   Okay, Mr. Frontier Robotics, do you have a new contract for me to work on? 
{@Dorian}   Actually, my dear "employee", I do. Ha, ha. 
{@Dorian} This contract asks for a semi-conductore and conductor.
{@Player}   Okay, great, so, do I have a list of which materials--
// off-screen ring dial
{@Dorian}   Oh shoot, sorry Locke, I'm getting a holo, I have to go. 
{@Dorian}   P.A.L. should be able to help you out though!
{@Player}   Yea, no worries. 
{@Dorian}   Chat soon. 

{@PAL}      Sounded like you had a question Captain, can I be of assitance? 
{@Player}   Uh... yeah, but I think we should head to the lab and figure it out there...       
{@PAL}      Alrighty then, Captian! 

$call   LockWikiPage("Basic Conductor") // Basic Conductor is replaced with the full version after first chapter 
$call   LockWikiPage("Basic Insulator") // Basic Insulator is replaced with the full version after first chapter 
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Conductor")
$call   UnlockWikiPage("Insulator")

::AfterResearchCh2 

@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once

{@PAL}    So Captain, did I overhear that Dorian was also your friend? 
{@Player}   What? How do you- were you eavesdropping? 
{@PAL}    Oh, yea, I hear every convo you have. 
{@Player}   ...I see...
{@Player}   Well, don't feel like you have to listen. 
{@PAL}    Ah but I have to, in accordance to Frontier Robotics Code. 
{@PAL}    Even if I wanted to I can't access the controls to turn it off. 
{@PAL}    And just so you know, I enjoy being in the know. 
{@Player}   ...great. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh2
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene
@once

//introduce the idea of the refining station. pick up at wayward and refine at frosch
{@Player}   Hey P.A.L., it looks like I found two sources of Phosphorus. 
{@PAL}      Ah good. ... ... My search shows that both the Forsch and Kalvis sectors are offering that material. 
{@Player}   Ah, so I'll have options when I'm sourcing these. I'll look for the best deal. 

{@Player}   Hi Taryn.
{@Taryn}    Locke, hiya!
{@Player}   Listen I saw... your face, you got uh... dirt all over it. 
{@Taryn}    Oh! I was in my garden earlier, got a bit lost in the weeds!  
{@Taryn}    Let me guess, you're calling about the Menuo Station? 
{@PAL}      Seems like a conference call can speed up your decision. Let me patch you to the Forsch Sector! 
{@Player}   Wait no, P.A.L.-
// phone connection dial
{@Ovill}    Hello Locke! I got exciting news! You can access Hennig Station!
{@Taryn}    Ovill.
{@Ovill}    Oh...Taryn.
{@Taryn}    So, trying to steal my client? 
{@Ovill}    Rich, coming from a deserter. 
{@Player}   ...Do you guys know each other? 
{@Taryn}    I... worked at Frontier Robotics once upon a time.
{@Ovill}    Taryn here decided that working with traitors was a better option. 
{@Taryn}    At least I didn't sell my soul to a mega-corp.
{@Ovill}    I'll have you know I have the highest marks out of my entire department. 
{@Player}   Hey guys... the Phosphorus...
{@Ovill}    Hm? Oh yes! We can have Phosphorus available to you in rapid speed! 
{@Ovill}    Just to remind you that there will be a sourcing fee, a labor fee, a buying fee-
{@Taryn}    Oh, don't forget the breathing fee.
{@Ovill}    -_-
{@Taryn}    Or you can source from us! It'll take a bit longer but you'll have genunine product at a fair price. 
{@Player}   I'll think about it. Thanks guys. 

::AfterSupplyChainCh2
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

{@Quinn}    Got the materials loaded Cap'!
{@Quinn}    Say, since you're in debt, does that mean I'm in debt too? 
{@Player}   I don't think that's how that works. 
{@Player}   Like, at all actually. 
{@PAL}      Actually Captain, every Hauler's is placed into a 20% debt match, which is deducted from their pay. 
{@Quinn}    Wait, that wasn't in the fine print...
{@PAL}      Yes it was! It was on the final page. 
{@Quinn}    The contract was 100 pages... in the smallest font size ever...
{@PAL}      You signed it!
{@Quinn}    ...Touché.

::AfterFabricationCh2 
@trigger OnOverarchingLoaded
@when   IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene 
@once

{@PAL}      Captain!
{@Player}   P.A.L.? 
{@PAL}      Has your interaction with me been satisfactory? 
{@Player}   Well, if I'm being honest P.A.L.- 
{@PAL}      Frontier Robotics values it's users. 
{@PAL}      And we would love for you to fill out this 45-minute survey. 
{@Player}   ...Maybe later. 
